None. This project has no separate API: <%#hasWeb%>the <%webName%> app renders the page itself<%#hasMobile%> and the <%mobileName%> app computes the greeting itself<%/hasMobile%><%/hasWeb%><%^hasWeb%>the <%mobileName%> app computes the greeting itself<%/hasWeb%>.

